<!DOCTYPE softwarelist SYSTEM "softwarelist.dtd">
<!--
Software for the Micronique Hector HRX computer, also compatible with the Hector MX.
Not backwards compatible with Hector 1 or Hector 2HR computers.

There are 3 different methods for loading software:

1. Software which can be loaded by selecting the CASSETTE option in the menu and starting the tape.

2. Software which requires FORTH to be loaded first. 
   Select the FORTH option in the menu, then reset the machine.
   The software can be loaded by selecting the CASSETTE option in the menu and starting the tape.
   This does not currently seem to work on the HRX, but does work on the MX.

3. Software which requires BASIC 3X to be loaded first. 
   For the HRX, BASIC 3X needs to be loaded first from tape using the first option above.
   For the MX it can be selected from the menu. 
   Once basic loads, type LOAD, then ENTER and start the tape. 
   If required, select RUN then ENTER once loading completes.
-->

